   "lines": [
    "Reached Chicago in",
    "morning. Thanks to a",
    "great free-mason",
    "meeting could hardly",
    "get rooms. Boiling",
    "hot; don't know",
    "where to go; in a",
    "general stew.",
    "Later in the evening",
    "got hold of a man",
    "named Wilcox, and",
    "will go to his farm",
    "till Sept."
   ],
